# Project Planning & Roadmap Document

## 1. Project Objectives
This document establishes the strategic planning, milestone timelines, and resource allocation for the execution of the project.

---

## 2. Phase Breakdown & Milestones
* **Phase 1: Research & Requirements (Weeks 1-2)**
  * Finalize functional and non-functional requirements.
  * Obtain stakeholder sign-off on project scope.
* **Phase 2: Architecture & Design (Weeks 3-4)**
  * Design system components and data flow architecture.
  * Establish security and access control protocols.
* **Phase 3: Development & Implementation (Weeks 5-8)**
  * Implement agent reasoning loops and tool integrations.
  * Build core features and connect data stores.
* **Phase 4: Testing & Deployment (Weeks 9-10)**
  * Conduct rigorous quality assurance and hallucination testing.
  * Deploy to enterprise production environment.

---

## 3. Resource Allocation
* **Development Team**: Focuses on core implementation and coding tasks.
* **QA & Security Team**: Validates system resilience, data privacy, and compliance guidelines.
